{"projectInfo":{"name":"6PE配置","path":"6pe","visibility":2,"categoryId":40,"introduction":"通过配置6PE实现利用MPLS技术跨越运营商的IPv4网络连接隔离的两个IPv6用户网络。其中：运营商网络内部采用OSPF作为IGP路由协议。PE 1和PE 2为运营商网络的边缘设备，PE 1和PE 2之间建立IPv4 IBGP连接。CE 1和CE 2为IPv6用户网络的边缘设备，用户网络通过该设备接入运营商网络。CE与PE之间配置IPv6静态路由，以指导IPv6报文的转发。","label":["6PE"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"PE-2","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\PE-2.cfg"},{"resourceName":"PE-1","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\PE-1.cfg"},{"resourceName":"CE-2","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\CE-2.cfg"},{"resourceName":"CE-1","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\CE-1.cfg"}]}